WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.672
Tap + Line Item, at the top right of the Line Items list.

00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:11.000
Every separate thing they are buying gets its own line. Do not pile different items into one line.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.832
Type the line name. Start with how many, then the size, then one side or two, then what it is.

00:00:17.832 --> 00:00:26.224
Our banner line reads: 1 - 48 inch wide by 96 inch high, double sided BANNER, with GROMMETS.

00:00:26.224 --> 00:00:32.552
Tap Line Item Category and pick the closest one. Yard signs are Outdoor Signage.

00:00:32.552 --> 00:00:43.752
Now pick the product. A flat sign is Flatbed, In-House. A banner or a decal is Roll Stock Prints. Our banner is Roll Stock Prints. Then tap Next.

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:46.792
Pick the material we are printing on.

00:00:46.792 --> 00:00:49.392
Pick the machine it runs on.

00:00:49.392 --> 00:00:56.824
Set the width, the height, and how many. Check they match the name you typed. One side or two sides.

00:00:56.824 --> 00:01:02.552
Your price shows at the top. If it looks wrong, check the size and the count before you save.

00:01:02.552 --> 00:01:08.832
Tap Save Changes. That line is on the estimate. Add the next thing they are buying the same way.
